# RMG settings for the plasma lineage.
#
# Without this file `database.directory` resolves to the sibling `RMG-database`
# checkout, which is the polymer-branch database and carries none of the plasma
# families -- every plasma suite then fails with
#   DatabaseError: Unrecognized item "Plasma_Electron_Attachment"
# which looks exactly like a regression and is not one.
#
# The path is relative on purpose. RMG resolves it against the current working
# directory, and every worktree on this lineage sits as a sibling of
# RMG-database-plasma, so this one line is correct from the repo root of any of
# them without naming a machine or a user.
# I-123 AUDIT BRANCH ONLY. On `plasma` this line reads
#   database.directory = ../RMG-database-plasma/input
# and it must go back to that before any merge to `plasma`. The I-123 audit merges a
# candidate set in BOTH repositories, so the RMG-Py union must be tested against the
# RMG-database union rather than against the plasma database worktree -- otherwise the
# ionisation and radiative-recombination libraries the audit exists to exercise are
# simply absent, and the suite measures the wrong pair.
#
# Second pass (i123b-reaudit): the database half of the pair is now the sibling
# RMG-database-i123b-reaudit worktree, not the first pass's RMG-database-i123-integration.
# Same hazard, same revert requirement -- this line is one of the two commits that must
# come out before this branch is merge-clean for `plasma`.
#
# Third pass (i123c-audit): repointed again, at this pass's own sibling
# RMG-database-i123c-audit worktree. The second pass's path named a worktree this pass does
# not own, and a run from this repo root would have loaded a database tree another branch is
# free to move under it. THREE commits now carry this pin -- the first pass's ae52de38a, the
# second pass's 9874fc706, and this one -- and all three must come out before this lineage is
# merge-clean for `plasma`, which must read
#   database.directory = ../RMG-database-plasma/input
#
# Fourth pass (i123d-audit): repointed again, at this pass's own sibling
# RMG-database-i123d-audit worktree, for exactly the reason the third pass gave. The line
# inherited on this branch named RMG-database-i123c-audit, which is the THIRD pass's worktree
# and not this one's; a run from this repo root would have loaded a database tree another
# branch may move under it, and the ionisation and recombination libraries this audit exists
# to exercise would have been read from someone else's checkout. FOUR commits now carry this
# pin -- ae52de38a, 9874fc706, 34de41c76, and this one -- and all four must come out before
# this lineage is merge-clean for `plasma`, which must read
#   database.directory = ../RMG-database-plasma/input
#
# Fifth pass (i148-seed-placement): repointed again, at this pass's own sibling
# RMG-database-i148-seed-placement worktree, for exactly the reason the third and fourth
# passes gave. The line inherited on this branch named RMG-database-i123d-audit, the FOURTH
# pass's worktree and not this one's; four consecutive passes each inherited a pointer to a
# checkout they did not own, and two meaningless greens resulted. FIVE commits now carry this
# pin -- ae52de38a, 9874fc706, 34de41c76, cd6cde425, and this one -- and all five must come
# out before this lineage is merge-clean for `plasma`, which must read
#   database.directory = ../RMG-database-plasma/input
#
# Sixth pass (i123e-audit): repointed again, at this pass's own sibling
# RMG-database-i123e-audit worktree, for exactly the reason every pass since the third gave.
# The line inherited on this branch named RMG-database-i148-seed-placement, the FIFTH pass's
# worktree and not this one's -- the recurring defect the sibling untracking branch exists to
# end, and it has now caught five passes running. SIX commits now carry this pin --
# ae52de38a, 9874fc706, 34de41c76, cd6cde425, ce93e6c12, and this one -- and all six must
# come out before this lineage is merge-clean for `plasma`, which must read
#   database.directory = ../RMG-database-plasma/input
database.directory = ../RMG-database-i123e-audit/input
